        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> AI FOR RESEARCH · BUILT AS INSTRUMENTS</div>
        <h1>Research deserves<br/><span>better interfaces.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Aiseeki is a growing constellation of research agents — designed to work with scientific context, deterministic tools, and reviewable execution instead of hiding everything inside a chat box.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="primary-btn magnetic" href="https://genecode-agent.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>Open GeneCode</span><i>↗</i></a>
          <a class="ghost-btn" href="#tools">Explore the lab <span>↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-row"><span>LOCAL-FIRST</span><i></i><span>AUDITABLE</span><i></i><span>TOOL-GROUNDED</span></div>
      </div>

