        <span class="kicker">01 / THE TOOL CONSTELLATION</span>
        <div><h2>One research layer.<br/>Many specialized instruments.</h2><p>Start with GeneCode. Add focused agents over time. Keep one interaction language across the entire research stack.</p></div>
      </div>

