          <article class="module-card reveal"><div class="module-status"><i></i><span>LAB</span></div><div class="module-glyph glyph-3"><i></i><b></b><em></em></div><div><h3>Methods</h3><p>Protocol intelligence</p></div><small>IN DEVELOPMENT</small></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="principles section-pad" id="principles">
      <div class="principles-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <span class="kicker">02 / RESEARCH, NOT CHAT</span>
        <div><h2>Built like an instrument.<br/>Not another empty textbox.</h2><p>The interface should expose context, tools, state, and provenance — so AI feels embedded in the work rather than floating above it.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-grid">
        <article class="principle-card reveal"><span>01</span><div class="principle-icon context-icon"><i></i><b></b><em></em></div><h3>Context-aware</h3><p>The open sequence, selected region, paper set, analysis state, or experiment becomes part of the working context.</p></article>
        <article class="principle-card reveal"><span>02</span><div class="principle-icon tool-icon"><i></i><b></b><em></em></div><h3>Tool-grounded</h3><p>Deterministic scientific tools remain the source of truth for calculations, analysis, and edits.</p></article>
        <article class="principle-card reveal"><span>03</span><div class="principle-icon trace-icon"><i></i><b></b><em></em></div><h3>Reviewable</h3><p>Keep steps, changes, and outputs visible so researchers can inspect what happened and reproduce the work.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workflow section-pad" id="workflow">
      <div class="workflow-copy reveal">
        <span class="kicker">03 / FROM INTENT TO EXECUTION</span>
        <h2>Watch the agent<br/>touch the science.</h2>
        <p>Aiseeki makes the transition from question → context → tool → result legible. The motion itself explains the product.</p>
        <div class="workflow-steps">
          <button class="workflow-step active" type="button" data-step="1"><span>01</span><div><b>INTENT</b><small>Research task enters</small></div></button>
          <button class="workflow-step" type="button" data-step="2"><span>02</span><div><b>CONTEXT</b><small>Workspace is read</small></div></button>
          <button class="workflow-step" type="button" data-step="3"><span>03</span><div><b>TOOLS</b><small>Method executes</small></div></button>
          <button class="workflow-step" type="button" data-step="4"><span>04</span><div><b>REVIEW</b><small>Result stays visible</small></div></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-console reveal">
        <div class="console-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>research-session / genecode</b><i>LIVE</i></div>
        <div class="console-body">
          <div class="console-map" aria-hidden="true"><div class="map-grid"></div><div class="map-orbit orbit-1"></div><div class="map-orbit orbit-2"></div><div class="map-core"><span>GC</span></div><div class="map-node mn-1">SEQ</div><div class="map-node mn-2">PCR</div><div class="map-node mn-3">sg</div></div>
          <div class="console-log"><div class="log-line is-active"><span>01</span><p><b>task.received</b><small>Design primers for selected region</small></p><i>✓</i></div><div class="log-line"><span>02</span><p><b>context.read</b><small>Active sequence · 4,812 bp</small></p><i>✓</i></div><div class="log-line"><span>03</span><p><b>tool.execute</b><small>Primer constraints validated</small></p><i>✓</i></div><div class="log-line"><span>04</span><p><b>result.review</b><small>2 candidate primer pairs ready</small></p><i>✓</i></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="console-footer"><span>TRACE ID / AX-02841</span><div><i></i> VERIFIED EXECUTION</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="roadmap section-pad" id="roadmap">
      <div class="roadmap-shell reveal">
        <div class="roadmap-copy"><span class="kicker">04 / BUILD THE RESEARCH LAYER</span><h2>A platform that grows<br/>one instrument at a time.</h2><p>GeneCode is the first module. The long-term product is a coherent family of research agents with shared identity, interaction patterns, and provenance.</p><a class="primary-btn magnetic" href="https://github.com/zjuphD/GeneCode" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>Follow the build</span><i>↗</i></a></div>
        <div class="roadmap-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="radar"></div><div class="road-line rl-1"></div><div class="road-line rl-2"></div><div class="road-line rl-3"></div><div class="road-node rn-1"><span></span><b>GENECODE</b><small>LIVE</small></div><div class="road-node rn-2"><span></span><b>NEXT TOOL</b><small>BUILD</small></div><div class="road-node rn-3"><span></span><b>RESEARCH OS</b><small>SCALE</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

